The files in library/ are optimized copies (meshopt, resized textures) of
third-party art under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication), listed per pack
below. The voxel and ps1 sets are made from the low-poly models and the
Screaming Brain Studios textures below. Crediting is not required by CC0;
we credit anyway. The CC0 1.0 legal code is in CC0-1.0.txt.

Quaternius (https://quaternius.com), CC0 1.0
- Animated characters, monsters (blob, flying and big bodies), animals,
  dinosaurs, robots, tanks, weapons and props.
- Files: per-model GLBs on Poly Pizza uploaded by Quaternius
  (https://poly.pizza/u/Quaternius); each asset's model page is recorded
  in manifest/lowpoly.json and states Public Domain (CC0). Quaternius's
  pack pages (https://quaternius.com/packs/*) state "License CC0". Models
  Poly Pizza lists under CC-BY are not used.

